## Close — wrap up

**Spec card:** ${trigger.card_id}
**Plan:** ${nodes.plan.output.task_count} tasks planned

### Determine the final verdict:

Read the verify card verdict: ${nodes.verify.output.verdict}
If the fix→re-verify loop ran, read: ${nodes.re-verify.output.verdict}

- If verify PASSED (no fix needed): write journal, reflection, complete with verdict=merged
- If re-verify PASSED (fix loop succeeded): write journal noting findings fixed, complete with verdict=merged
- If verify or re-verify ESCALATED: read findings, classify (defect-bug/contract-gap/harness/wrong-slice), route appropriately. Complete with verdict=escalated

**Completion metadata:**
```
{verdict: "merged"|"escalated", tasks_planned: ${nodes.plan.output.task_count}, tasks_completed: ${nodes.plan.output.task_count}, escalate_reason: ""}
```
